    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῑκ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκη</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				victory,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.2.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς</span> N., =
			<i>Juppiter Victor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				47.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					18.169
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάλλας ν.,</span> as <i>the
				giver of victory,</i> ib. <i><span class="en">
				37.623
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νικαίην,</span>
			
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκην,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
